    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-03">Extend `CommunicationTimeline` with a regarding mode taking `(entityType, id)`; render threads as collapsible groups (name + message count) each expanding to the interleaved email+chat timeline; call `by-regarding` (FR-01); reuse the R1 component rendering; no client-side access logic (server-filtered). Scope: the shared component only — no PCF, no form placement.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-03">Access parity — the component renders whatever the access-filtered `by-regarding` endpoint returns; it MUST NOT re-derive privacy, hide rows, or apply any access/privacy filter client-side. Scope: this component + its API wrapper.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-04">No client-side ACS SDK — the component MUST NOT import any `@azure/communication-*` package (R1 rule carried into R2). Reads persisted `sprk_communication` records via the BFF only. Grep-verified.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent UI v9 ONLY (`@fluentui/react-components`); `makeStyles` + `tokens`; dark mode via host `FluentProvider`; no hardcoded colors; no v8/v0. The new group header + expand/collapse chrome use semantic tokens.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Component + sub-components MUST NOT import `@spaarke/auth`. The host injects `authenticatedFetch` via props; `communicationTimelineApi.readByRegarding` forwards it.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Shared-library rules — the change lives in `@spaarke/ui-components`; no fork of the timeline; reuse the existing `buildTimeline`/`MessageRow`/`ChannelBadge`; export via the lib barrel; no cross-package source-path imports.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-026">Path-A exception: this component is packaged as a form-bound PCF (task 021), NOT a Code Page. Cite the exception in the PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">§11 extend-only — do NOT create a second timeline component; reuse the R1 render engine and existing thread-id mode. State the FR-03 failure mode + "extends CommunicationTimeline, no new component" in the PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Client-only TypeScript — NO BFF publish-size / CVE obligation (root §10 N/A). Build via `npm run build` (dev) — NOT dotnet.</constraint>
  </constraints>

